<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Systemat share offer closed early.</title>
<headline>Belgian Systemat share offer closed early.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian hi-tech firm  Systemat NV's public share offer was closed early on Tuesday, lead manager Banque Bruxelles Lambert (BBL) said.</p>
<p>Systemat, an information technology services provider with strong growth ambitions, is seeking to list 49 percent of its capital on the Brussels bourse from March 26.</p>
</text>
